  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\" \n\n\"Well hello,\" I said to the bee. \"I'm not really in the mood of issuing any orders.\" The bee buzzed slightly and hovered around me. I wondered why the bee called be your majesty but I thought I would play along. \"What would you like to have me do?\" I asked the bee. \n\n\"You must issue an order,\" said the bee. And this gave me a great idea. Since I could give the bees orders , I could tell them to do whatever I wanted. And this could include not stinging me. Since I'm allergic that would be nice. \"Alright,\" I said to the bee. \"I'll give this one order.",
